0..77 Comment "// A capability a scope introduces lives in that scope\'s region, and its type"
78..156 Comment "// says so: `Cap {exit} at c` is the capability living until the scope binding"
157..236 Comment "// `c` ends. A region is a static extent, ordered by outlives and erased before"
237..313 Comment "// anything runs (Koronkevich and Bowman, _Type Universes as Kripke Worlds_,"
314..392 Comment "// ICFP 2025, doi:10.1145/3747532): a value of an outer region may stand in an"
393..425 Comment "// inner one, never the reverse."
